<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A9" title="In MoSEs : Uncertainty-Aware AI-Generated Text Detection via Mixture of Stylistics Experts with Conditional Thresholds" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">I </span>Experimental Results under Other Prompt Generation Ways</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A10" title="In MoSEs : Uncertainty-Aware AI-Generated Text Detection via Mixture of Stylistics Experts with Conditional Thresholds" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">J </span>Examples of Evaluation Datasets</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
